    <string name="l_about">About</string>
    <string name="x_version">DVPL Mod Helper v</string>
    <string name="t_tagline">\nTexture / DVPL / Wwise audio conversion tool for World of Tanks Blitz</string>
    <string name="t_wise_tip">Wwise tip: same-name .bnk and .pck exist in pairs — bnk holds the event table and the first few KB of each sound; full audio streams from .pck on demand. They serve different purposes and are not interchangeable, so replacing audio means repacking both files.</string>
